      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "とある村人たちのために私が作った剣を\n村を襲った盗賊の頭が使っているという。\nよければ彼らを倒して、その武器を\n彼らごと葬ってくれないだろうか？",
        "official_en": "I heard that a thief leader who ravaged a village is\nwielding a sword I once forged for its defense. I'd be\ngrateful if you could defeat those rogues and then\nbury that weapon where you find them.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
